Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.26,0:00:03.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But that all comes to an end this evening.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这一切 都将在今晚落幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:06.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}28{\fs68}号凌晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.21,0:00:07.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴塞尔首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:10.79,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}告别仪式后 瓦林卡回到中央球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:13.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}打职业巡回赛最后一战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:16.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}19{\fs68}次来到巴塞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:18.59,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一次 每多打一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:20.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}告别就能晚一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}熟悉的反拍 他还在挥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:28.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}领先 比分还紧紧缠在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's really good. Got down with the leg.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N处理得真好 俯身把这一球救了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:35.02,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 他还领先着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:38.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}可打到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 莱赫奇卡开始逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:40.58,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}瓦林卡的发球局被拖进苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:43.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}盘末的压力落到了自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:52.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Strong finish from Jiri Lehecka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱赫奇卡在盘末强势收官
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:55.27,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 先丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.27,0:00:58.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}对{\fs78}41{\fs68}岁的瓦林卡来说 再丢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:00.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}职业巡回赛就到这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:03.97,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}可他没有让这场告别很快结束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:07.40,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘 他重新守住发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.20,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一局一局跟着走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.20,0:01:12.68,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}那些熟悉的反拍 上网和奔跑还在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:16.27,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}每一次赢分 主场的声音就再响一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:24.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 再到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.30,0:01:27.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}比分没有拉开 瓦林卡继续跟住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:31.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}想把比赛带下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:34.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}每一次向前压 都要自己争
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's such an awkward shot to try and find.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N要打出这样的球 实在太难了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:53.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's the best rally of the match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是本场最精彩的一个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.21,0:01:56.59,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一局守住了 {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:58.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}瓦林卡用奔跑和对抗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:02:01.08,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}把比赛重新撑到了盘末
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.08,0:02:04.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}告别就在眼前 他仍然没有停下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:07.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 又到了盘末
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:09.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}瓦林卡继续向前压
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:12.44,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}试着把机会留在自己这一边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.33,0:02:16.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 只要再赢一局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.54,0:02:18.95,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}就能把比赛带进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.95,0:02:20.72,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}瓦林卡还在寻找机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}莱赫奇卡也没有放松
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:29.76,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a combination.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多漂亮的一组进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.45,0:02:32.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}莱赫奇卡守住发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.12,0:02:34.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 第二盘进入抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:35.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后一段路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:38.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}瓦林卡又要一分一分地争
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:41.17,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}抢七来到{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.17,0:02:42.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他还有追赶的空间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:44.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}可莱赫奇卡把球调开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}又把优势带向了赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:51.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's the way to manoeuvre the ball around the court.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就这样 调动对手 控制整个球场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.59,0:02:54.51,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}制胜分{\fs78}14{\fs68}比{\fs78}26{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:57.34,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}非受迫性失误{\fs78}30{\fs68}比{\fs78}25{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:03:00.39,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}火力和稳定 莱赫奇卡占了上风
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:03.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}瓦林卡还是把第二盘拖进了抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:23.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jiri Lehecka brings down the curtain on Stan Wawrinka's career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N瓦林卡的职业生涯 就此落幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:27.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A suitcase of incredible memories,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N留下了满满一箱 珍贵回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.94,0:03:32.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}in a career that has spanned 23 years,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这段生涯 横跨二十三年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:36.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and whose shot-making has dazzled us for decades.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N精妙击球 让我们惊叹数十年
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:39.88,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}But that all comes to an end this evening.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但这一切 都将在今晚落幕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:42.67,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后一战结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}熟悉的单手反拍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:46.02,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}和那些永不言弃的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:47.93,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}都留在了球迷心里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:51.04,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}你最难忘瓦林卡的哪一场比赛？
